 '                                    "text": "Record and report Record and '
 'report to the shop manager or the licensee the time of the incident, the '
 'table number/location, distinguishing features of the dog involved, details '
 'of the individuals involved, measures taken by staff, whether anyone was '
 'injured, and whether CCTV footage is available. If the incident involves a '
 'bite (Under the Rabies Ordinance (Cap. 421), its keeper must immediately '
 'report the incident to the nearest police station without delay), fighting '
 'dog or a known dangerous dog, severe loss of control, or a possible breach '
 "of the FEHD's licensing conditions, consideration should be given to making "
 'a follow-up report to the Police, the AFCD or the FEHD.",\n'
