 '                                "start_col_offset_idx": 1,\n'
 '                                "end_col_offset_idx": 2,\n'
 '                                "text": "Issue verbal instructions '
 'immediately The restaurant owner or staff should immediately require, in a '
 'clear and concise manner, the dog owner to control the dog by, for examples, '
 'shortening the dog leashes, bringing the dog back to his seat, stopping the '
 'dog from approaching other customers or removing the dog from the indoor '
 'area immediately. If the relevant requirements are already stated in the '
 'house rules, enforce them directly, and avoid getting into arguments with '
 'the dog owners over legal details.",\n'
