 '                                "end_col_offset_idx": 2,\n'
 '                                "text": "Separate the crowd and ensure the '
 'safety of the scene If the situation is escalating, arrange for the affected '
 'customers to leave the scene first, prevent other customers from gathering '
 'around, provoking, or touching the dog, and suspend seating new customers '
 'near the incident location. Any food, utensils or hot drinks near the '
 'incident location should be removed as soon as possible to reduce risks to '
 'people and food safety.",\n'
