 'upon receiving the referral from the Police. Should the dog owner or the '
 'restaurant operator be found to have violated food business regulations or '
 'licensing conditions, the FEHD will take follow-up action upon receipt of '
 'the report. (Members of the public may call 1823 to make suggestions, '
 'enquiries, or complaints.)",\n'
